WEBVTT

00:57:26.371 --> 00:57:32.101
One possible way is to offer
some kind of special assistance

00:57:32.125 --> 00:57:33.791
to people over 80,

00:57:33.815 --> 00:57:38.172
that they are entitled
to five or 10 hours of care per week.

00:57:38.196 --> 00:57:43.172
And that's supported as a part
of the overall health package

00:57:43.196 --> 00:57:48.918
and that's the five or 10 hours a week
will be paid at 2x minimum wage.

00:57:48.942 --> 00:57:53.260
So that will provide a better pay
for a large number of people

00:57:53.284 --> 00:57:55.291
with incentives to move in.

00:57:55.315 --> 00:57:58.783
So I think the money
should be selectively spent.

00:57:58.807 --> 00:58:01.887
I do think a pool of money
needs to be created